\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BgSwD4XuG5AQ7kNvwFmFnZ2&_nc_oc=Adq5NZhcIarKOpQd20rsWwXBscbzQqQEEdyBGv3zxhdGqQ-610UqtYZ7oqbQ0np7tYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxXgDAOA0DJtNaulx4m6JWsCM3Ps0HEKTmxTS4G5-Qzg&oe=6B032076"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q7cQrwKGr0IQ7kNvwHcgSB-&_nc_oc=Adp6jxikGzf8MmXIEUMsQeBErd1y-pBzJZubvSOwdyXwyRPRXB63pLFCsbiWYiYNrA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHNS7010rCb8yIKgbdhnbpgQJ7BvVX-0VCWRiRuvrD4Q&oe=6B031C76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SVSYCZs-dFEQ7kNvwEcIi2V&_nc_oc=AdpYjM0g-_UTa-4Ck9vrzSJIVLxyFtPDE4MMDjU3gj5F7xeM_JEhdXrnpU3NeX8W4q4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRSO3U3WUnE_qETDca_FcwIDJuqDRjzUAp79qJ7j7sNIA&oe=6B0320FE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u